{
  "$comment": "Reviewed input, not yet generated output. See README.md. Every setting path the pinned OMP runtime publishes must be explicitly claimed by exactly one named section of exactly one page. Section `keys` arrays are the committed expansion of `claims` and must not be hand-edited; CI regenerates and requires an empty diff.",
